      "details": "<p class=\"p1\"><em>U\u015fm\u016bneyn</em>:\u00a0It is a small town of Middle Egypt. There is no end to the remains and monuments of its ancient construction. In sum, it is not the Ushm\u016bn (<em>U\u015fm\u016bn</em>) that lies near Damietta (<em>Dimy\u0101\u1e6d</em>). [translation]</p>",
